the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e4L3dAoq8asQ7kNvwEHhzQV&_nc_oc=AdrtwzXn2HVPkii4dy4hg9GWe8q5R8HKvv7aJb93Xs1QQGHClfO4K5gayhk3Y0uEFdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFFSpgS3ChWQXuvElPaKRdeliapJAG1FTteEt80pU5sZQ&oe=6A79B4C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kYum8QpOeH4Q7kNvwHYTyZE&_nc_oc=AdpymP_v3MycJ-UfePqDXEJdX-dIqlVXqxkekyL-kATfSyDfel5aQESIy01wfZK-gJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHTDKFH7cMUqFi9m47GFWFXf5Zh-4fU5VGykBNUdseACA&oe=6A79E558"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=20vj8_Ng_v4Q7kNvwEdU67n&_nc_oc=AdrkuWh9BLG6NgfFWlB_RvpqeTPMR-4rf4RCnkBBKPC_JajIHt1qkBVNc_yMaOsREeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFgsqvuvRGpdZav3XZrANnLbttbVBdJLoSyUQ2PUrisIg&oe=6A79C03C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080